111,
"- 2026-11-13: No gate builds the separate `fuzz/` workspace, so a change to a type its targets construct is compile-checked on the pinned nightly of `fuzz/rust-toolchain.toml`, offline and installing nothing, under a kill deadline: `RUSTUP_AUTO_INSTALL=0 timeout -k 10 600 cargo +<nightly> check --offline --manifest-path fuzz/Cargo.toml --bins`.",
112
],
".claude/rules/verification-harness.md": [
72,
"- 2026-10-20: `target/debug/viola` is a hard link cargo re-points per feature set, so a `fake-agent` build between a live rig's setup and its start swaps the binary under it: read the build's hash right before the start, and restore a ledgered build by `ln -f` from its `target/debug/deps/` artifact.",
73
]
},
